{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Shopping Spree", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Trend Setters", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Making Comparisons", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">as</span> + adjective/adverb + <span class=\"italic\">as</span> to make comparisons when the things we are comparing are equal in some way:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is <span class=\"strong\">as soft as</span> a sweater!</span><br/><br/>We use <span class=\"italic\">not as ... as</span> to make comparisons between things which aren't equal:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is<span class=\"strong\">n't as expensive as</span> that one.</span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I'm not <span class=\"strong\">as tuned into the fashion scene as</span> you are, Sal.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I don't find hipster style <span class=\"strong\">as interesting as</span> other ways of dressing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Being a follower is not <span class=\"strong\">as compelling as</span> standing out in a crowd. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Being seen in some worlds is <span class=\"strong\">just as important as</span> blending in others. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I can be <span class=\"strong\">as hipster as</span> the next person!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Superlatives and Comparatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a comparative to compare somebody or something to <span class=\"strong\">one</span> other person or thing.<br/><br/>You use a superlative to compare somebody or something to the whole <span class=\"strong\">group</span> that he, she or it belongs to.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for information on how to form the comparative and superlative:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"big\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bigger\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the biggest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Most adjectives:<br/><br/>+er, +-est\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"late\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"later\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the latest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjectives ending in -e:<br/><br/>+r, +-st\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thrifty\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thriftier\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the thriftiest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2-syllable adje\u00ad\u00ad\u00adctives ending in -y:<br/><br/>+ier, +iest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ridiculous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more ridiculous \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most ridiculous \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3+-syllable adjectives:<br/><br/>more + adjective<br/><br/>most + adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good<br/>bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than)<br/>worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best<br/>the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular comparisons\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<ul><li>you use <span class=\"strong\">than</span> after comparatives</li><li>you add <span class=\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form to describe people, places and things.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "That's the most ridiculous way to socialize I've ever heard!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I think you have to buck the bigger trends. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I don't think it's a better lifestyle, just a more distinctive one. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They are the thriftiest bunch. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It's a cheaper way to live.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hip", "type": "name"}, {"content": "cool", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It seems that all the hippest trend setters are wearing it these days. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about hipsters.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "faux", "type": "name"}, {"content": "made to look real, but not real", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She's wear a faux fur coat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ironic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "saying one thing, but meaning another ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The saying on her T-shirt is ironic. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gingham", "type": "name"}, {"content": "cotton cloth with two colors in a square pattern.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Those gingham tops are good to wear in summer heat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "paisley", "type": "name"}, {"content": "patterned with curved shapes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The paisley tops are totally hip.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "contrived", "type": "name"}, {"content": "artificial", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Hipster style seems so contrived!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to buck", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go against", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You have to buck the bigger trends to stand out from the crowd.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "thrifty", "type": "name"}, {"content": "using money carefully", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are the thriftiest bunch because it's cheaper.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of some activities you like to do and places you like to go with friends.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss which activities are better and which are you favorite (use comparatives and superlatives).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph describing your perfect weekend.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about socializing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I compare social activities and say which ones I like best.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about the perfect social weekend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph aloud and correct any errors I find.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le07ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Melodie was saying that vintage clothing is making a comeback.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes. It seems that all the hippiest trend setters are wearing it these days.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not as tuned into the fashion scene as you are, Sal.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I do read the latest fashion sheets at work. All of the hipsters are into vintage clothing. They're driving some of the styles we see in stores.  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: All those skinny jeans , faux glasses and ironic tops in gingham and paisley. It's a little folksy and Americana. Personally I don't find hipster style as interesting as other ways of dressing. It all seems so contrived!"}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "32000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think you have to buck the bigger trends. Being a follower is not as compelling as standing out in a crowd. Being seen in some worlds is just as important as blending in others. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How do hipsters socialize? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, some grow vegetables in garden plots together.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Really? That's the most ridiculous way to socialize I've ever heard!"}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "52000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: They go to nightclubs and hang out in cafes. They ride their bikes together everywhere. I don't think it's a better lifestyle, just a more distinctive one. They are the thriftiest bunch. It's a cheaper way to live.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ... browsing through thrift stores for lower-priced clothing ... I can be as hipster as the next person!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I didn't see that one coming!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le07ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le07ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about socializing, fashion and clothing.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can make comparisons using <span class=\"italic\">as ... as</span> and <span class=\"italic\">not as</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can compare two things or people and describe the quality of an object or a person. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you know about fashion trends?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How much do you consider the latest trends when you shop for new clothes?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Is a hipster lifes